    "body_html": "<p>In this episode, Peita is joined once again by Anne-Marie Esler, Co-Founder and Co-CEO Padua Solutions. She gives an update on the Padua software and website since their last appearance on the podcast, and preview what’s in store for the future.</p><p>‍</p><h4>Listen to the podcast: </h4><p><a href=\"https://ensombl.com/podcasts/advicetech67/\">https://ensombl.com/podcasts/advicetech67/</a></p><p>‍</p>"
