    "hero_image_url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/654b0db04fb918f226e44702/65654f4508c09b879a209336_budget.png",
    "body_html": "<p>Padua&#x27;s Head of Technical Advice, Rudy Haddad, summarises the key points from the 2023-24 Federal Budget and what they can mean for you. It is the Albanese government’s second budget since Labor took office last year. While the Budget features a few key proposals aimed at providing cost-of-living relief for Australians, it was light-on in the areas of taxation, superannuation and retirement planning.</p>"
