    "body_html": "<p>In this episode, Peita is joined by Matt and Anne-Marie Esler, Co-Founders of Padua. They discuss how Padua can be used to reduce the time and cost to produce high-quality advice.</p><p>‍</p><h4>Listen to the podcast</h4><p>‍</p><figure style=\"padding-bottom:33.723653395784545%\"><div><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/duU7WFbNOIc\" title=\"AdviceTech Podcast #23 - Padua\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div></figure><p>‍</p><blockquote>Original ensombl: knowledge post can be viewed here: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.xyadviser.com/podcasts/australia/advicetech23/\">https://www.xyadviser.com/podc...</a></blockquote>"
