    "title": "End of Financial Year strategies (FY22)",
    "date": "2022-05-17",
    "author": "Rudy Haddad",
    "source": null,
    "kind": "article",
    "category_slug": "data-trends",
    "excerpt": "With the end of the financial year fast approaching, now is the best time to take action. Hear from Rudy Haddad Padua’s Head of Technical, as he shares expert i…",
    "hero_image_url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/654b0db04fb918f226e44702/65652d8fdc195fa250fa4980_EOFY.png",
    "body_html": "<h3>AFA Webinar Summary</h3><p><br/></p><p>With the end of the financial year fast approaching, now is the best time to take action. Hear from Rudy Haddad Padua’s Head of Technical, as he shares expert insights into the opportunities available before financial year-end; and changes for the coming financial year.</p><p><br/></p><h3>Webinar on demand</h3><p><br/></p><figure style=\"padding-bottom:33.723653395784545%\"><div><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BHFEuomBiX4\" title=\"\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div></figure>"
